Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:44.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們依舊奮勇直前 直到燃盡生命之火
